@startuml 22_seq_fleet_refresh
title Workspace-authorized fleet refresh
actor Operator
participant "Flutter FleetScreen" as UI
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "Private PostgreSQL" as DB
Operator -> UI : Open dashboard
UI -> Auth : Existing operator session
Auth --> UI : JWT
loop Every 5 seconds while app active
 UI -> API : GET /api/v1/hosts\nBearer JWT
 API -> API : Verify JWT issuer/audience/role
 API -> DB : Read workspace memberships + scoped hosts
 DB --> API : Allowed host data and latest samples
 API -> API : Derive CONNECTED / STALE / REVOKED
 API --> UI : Authorized host list / 401 / 403
 UI -> UI : Render latest vs stale honestly
end
note bottom
 Current runtime uses global approved-operator allowlist;
 workspace filtering is v0.1.0 target not yet deployed.
end note
@enduml
